WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.710
After a test, tap the learner to see the results.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:12.316
The learner sheet shows the scores of the pretest, and later, the posttest.

00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:19.023
For numeracy, the app lists ARAL worksheets to begin with, based on the items the learner missed.

00:00:19.023 --> 00:00:22.737
Each item is linked to the worksheet that teaches that skill.

00:00:23.537 --> 00:00:27.586
You will see the same hints in the Today tab, when you record worksheets.

00:00:27.586 --> 00:00:30.748
They help you choose the next worksheet for each learner.

00:00:31.548 --> 00:00:34.291
For reading, the app suggests Basic or Plus.

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:41.212
In Key Stage two and three, the Today tab starts with that suggestion, and you can change it whenever you like.

00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:43.788
These are guides, not rules.

00:00:43.788 --> 00:00:48.608
The ARAL guides say that a learner moves on only when every item is correct.

00:00:48.608 --> 00:00:51.335
You know your learners best, so you decide.
